# Compound Component

When several UI pieces share one state, compose them under one parent. Do not prop-drill that state deeply.

```tsx
<ProductGallery>
  <ProductGallery.Image />
  <ProductGallery.Thumbs />
</ProductGallery>
```

Keep the selected-image state in the parent. Children read it from that compound's context.
